<title>USA: Simpson verdict reached - source.</title>
<headline>Simpson verdict reached - source.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The jury in O.J. Simpson's civil trial reached a verdict on Tuesday and a source close to the case said it would be announced within the hour.  </p>
<p>The verdict was reached after the panel of six men and six women had listened to four hours of readings of crucial evidence in the case including Simpson's testimony of his activities on the night his ex-wife's Nicole Brown Simpson and her friend Ronald Goldman were stabbed to death.</p>
</text>
